Chiqish yozish: (['a:b:'] - [':']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['-'] - ['--']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ([''] - ['--']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['--'] - ['']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ([''] - ['']), yangi-qator.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: y, yangi-qator.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x almashtirish: [''] bunga: ['xx'].
Chiqish yozish: ((x aynan: y) bu: ['OK'] yoki-u: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), yangi-qator.